{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20253","headline":"吊卢殷 七 · 孟郊","name":"吊卢殷 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初识漆鬓发，争爲新文章。\n夜踏明月桥，店饮吾曹床。\n醉啜二盃酿，名郁一县香。\n寺中摘梅花，园里翦浮芳。\n高嗜绿蔬羹，意轻肥腻羊。\n吟哦无滓韵，言语多古肠。\n白首忽然至，盛年如偷将。\n清浊俱莫追，何须駡沧浪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}